                        "sense_id": "a0e58ade-b009-3b9d-b440-2e8f61b9f2dd",
                        "entry_id": "b25a622e-1298-39ef-8878-4fb79bae0863",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A South American liana, Philodendron imbe."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a04c8ac-70e9-4025-b789-1249635d0f12",
                                "sense_id": "a0e58ade-b009-3b9d-b440-2e8f61b9f2dd",
                                "text": "Many vessels were built there; and the principal exports were wood and cordage, made of the imbé."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "77758591-c9b3-4be8-8885-959df0a5ae7b",
                                "sense_id": "a0e58ade-b009-3b9d-b440-2e8f61b9f2dd",
                                "text": "In Brazil there are at least six very different species of this family. […] The straight ropes on the right are the air-roots of the imbé; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "291f3613-5deb-4deb-b3da-2f801d8b1702",
                                "sense_id": "a0e58ade-b009-3b9d-b440-2e8f61b9f2dd",
                                "text": "Other curious plants grew at this spot, among which I noticed the aninga, a plant which belongs to the Colocasice. On the trees around, too, were many beautiful orchids and lianas, among which the rope-like roots of the large-leaved imbé attracted my attention; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4686a094-3239-41fd-8a7f-644a3ba36bfd",
                                "sense_id": "a0e58ade-b009-3b9d-b440-2e8f61b9f2dd",
                                "text": "Enthroned in the crown, a stately imbé, in the axils leafy bromelia with their gorgeous flowers, along the branches[…]. The lianas, like close-fitting blinds, drew an impenetrable curtain before our eyes; yet we continued to stare bewitched […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1beb63b3-9a2e-4c11-b427-0fdd7ade098d",
                                "sense_id": "a0e58ade-b009-3b9d-b440-2e8f61b9f2dd",
                                "text": "The weapons they use in these pursuits are finished with extraordinary skill. Their long bows are all veneered with bark from imbé lianas and their arrows are made of a wood of great elasticity and worked so well that they look machine-made."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
